1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,300
We must inspire the people of Saga to rise up and resist as one!

2
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,980
We can rid this country of the crooks who have taken over everything!

3
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:15,360
This time, the samurai of Saga will prevail!

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:16,460
Yugiri!

5
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:22,380
Thanks for the medicine. I'm sorry to trouble you for it.

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,240
Has your grandfather's condition improved recently?

7
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:28,960
There hasn't been much change. He mostly stays in his bed.

8
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,940
Even though I've finally figured out a way for us to reclaim Saga.

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,200
You seem to have plenty of comrades on your side now.

10
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:40,160
Yes, I do. And as a matter of fact, we've all been putting together a petition.

11
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:44,680
See? Look at it. We're taking this straight to the prefectural magistrate.

12
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:48,400
We're also going to talk to as many of the elders around here as possible.

13
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,600
I'm sure that'll make a sizable difference.

14
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:52,980
Right?

15
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:56,240
How can we accomplish anything with you acting like such a coward?

16
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,840
You're no samurai! Step outside!

17
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,960
It's time someone beat some sense into you!

18
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,940
It sounds like they're getting kind of worked up.

19
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,620
I should go in and intervene.

20
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,220
Excuse me?

21
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:07,860
How dare you!

22
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:10,960
I don't care if it's disrespectful. I'm telling you the truth!

23
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:24,140
I do it. And I'm not even iveling. I love you!

